('B', '**Early intervention:** across studies of young children, behavioral, developmental, and naturalistic developmental-behavioral interventions showed positive effects; limited to randomized trials, only developmental and naturalistic approaches held up, and with the strictest controls for bias no approach showed significant effects (Sandbank et al., 2020). Evidence for early intensive behavioral intervention (EIBI) was rated low to very low quality (Reichow et al., 2018).'),
